    "own R step"
  ],
  "origin": "qml",
  "component_type": "motion",
  "definition": "Moves a number one step inside its range by the mean R of the unit's own closed trades: toward its cautious side when the mean is below zero, away from it when the mean is above zero.",
  "boundaries": "A labelled placeholder, owner numbers talk. Moves only inside the number's range, one step at a time, after enough closed trades; a mean of exactly zero leaves the number where it is.",
  "recognition": "A risk fraction or a target multiple shrinks one step while the unit's own trades lose and grows back one step while they pay.",
